A command whose Broken holds a type error and shares its line with helper, a dead
declaration of its own. The type error skips Broken, so nothing is reported about
it, and leaves helper, whose source does not hold the error, to be reported.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/app

go 1.27
-- deadset.json --
{"target": {"kind": "application"}}
-- main.go --
package main

func main() {}

func Broken() int { return undefinedName }; func helper() {}
